  "details": {
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Backstory",
        "text": "Raised in the temple forge at Hammerfall, Ilsa learned that an oath, like a weld, holds\nonly if you heat both sides of it. See Ilsa backstory for the long version."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Personality Traits",
        "text": "Quiet until the forge is lit. Speaks in finished sentences or not at all."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Ideals",
        "text": "Duty. A promise spoken aloud is already half a debt."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Bonds",
        "text": "The temple that raised her, and the apprentice she left behind to finish her work."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Flaws",
        "text": "Mistakes stubbornness for conviction, and only notices afterwards."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Appearance",
        "text": "Four foot nine, grey-eyed, with a smith's forearms and a burn scar shaped like a rune\nshe will not explain."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Notes",
        "text": ""
      }
    ]
